message: >-
  When using the methods or results, cite the published ESWA article
  identified in preferred-citation and CITATION.bib. The repository can
  also be cited separately as software; empirical datasets retain their
  original attribution requirements.
type: software
title: "Scan-Level Reliability and Gross-Error Diagnosis in Wi-Fi Fingerprinting"
authors:
